      ],
      "source": "https://www.dhr.virginia.gov/historic-registers/078-0093/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A 1918 apple packing plant, later the Smoot tannery site, reflects the town’s long‑standing apple industry.",
